  "__class__": "Meeting",
  "transcript": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start": "00:12:11.430",
      "end": "00:12:22.650",
      "text": "Please be seated."
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start": "00:12:22.650",
      "end": "00:12:23.480",
      "text": "Thank you colleagues."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start": "00:12:23.480",
      "end": "00:12:26.990",
      "text": "So this is the third but special meeting of Cal,"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start": "00:12:26.990",
      "end": "00:12:27.940",
      "text": "everything meeting is special,"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start": "00:12:27.940",
      "end": "00:12:30.530",
      "text": "but this is actually a special meeting."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start": "00:12:30.530",
      "end": "00:12:34.910",
      "text": "And this is to deal with the agenda that you see before us."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start": "00:12:34.910",
      "end": "00:12:38.400",
      "text": "But let me start with our formal land acknowledgement,"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start": "00:12:38.400",
      "end": "00:12:41.160",
      "text": "the formal land acknowledgement."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start": "00:12:41.160",
      "end": "00:12:42.890",
      "text": "The city of London is situated on the traditional lands"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start": "00:12:42.890",
      "end": "00:12:45.090",
      "text": "of the Anishinaabak, Haudenosaunee, Lene Peowak,"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start": "00:12:45.090",
      "end": "00:12:46.250",
      "text": "and Adawandran."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start": "00:12:46.250",
      "end": "00:12:48.360",
      "text": "We honor respect the history, language,"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start": "00:12:48.360",
      "end": "00:12:49.950",
      "text": "and culture of the diverse indigenous people"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start": "00:12:49.950",
      "end": "00:12:51.590",
      "text": "who call this territory home."
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start": "00:12:51.590",
      "end": "00:12:53.430",
      "text": "The city of London is currently home"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start": "00:12:53.430",
      "end": "00:12:56.170",
      "text": "to many First Nation, M\u00c3\u00a9tis, and Inuit today."
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start": "00:12:56.170",
      "end": "00:12:57.980",
      "text": "As representatives of the people of the city of London,"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start": "00:12:57.980",
      "end": "00:12:59.430",
      "text": "we are grateful to have the opportunity"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start": "00:12:59.430",
      "end": "00:13:03.320",
      "text": "to work and live in this territory."
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start": "00:13:03.320",
      "end": "00:13:04.660",
      "text": "As well, the city of London is committed"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start": "00:13:04.660",
      "end": "00:13:07.340",
      "text": "to making every effort to provide alternate formats"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start": "00:13:07.340",
      "end": "00:13:09.920",
      "text": "and communication supports for meetings upon request."
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start": "00:13:09.920",
      "end": "00:13:11.470",
      "text": "To make a request specific to this meeting,"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start": "00:13:11.470",
      "end": "00:13:14.470",
      "text": "please contact council agenda at London.ca"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start": "00:13:14.470",
      "end": "00:13:19.710",
      "text": "or 519-661-2489, extension 2425."
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start": "00:13:19.710",
      "end": "00:13:23.280",
      "text": "Now colleagues, this is a meeting of council,"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start": "00:13:23.280",
      "end": "00:13:24.400",
      "text": "but given it's a special meeting,"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start": "00:13:24.400",
      "end": "00:13:26.260",
      "text": "we don't have an old Canada singer,"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start": "00:13:26.260",
      "end": "00:13:28.410",
      "text": "but I think our preference last time was to continue"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start": "00:13:28.410",
      "end": "00:13:30.990",
      "text": "and do that anyways, so we all get to do that together."
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start": "00:13:30.990",
      "end": "00:13:34.310",
      "text": "So I would ask you to join me in rising"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start": "00:13:34.310",
      "end": "00:13:35.510",
      "text": "and singing national anthem,"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start": "00:13:35.510",
      "end": "00:14:35.840",
      "text": "which I'll ask Councillor Cudi to start us off on."
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start": "00:14:35.840",
      "end": "00:14:38.080",
      "text": "Thank you very much, please be seated."
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start": "00:14:38.080",
      "end": "00:14:41.990",
      "text": "Once again, reminds us why we invite professional singers."
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start": "00:14:41.990",
      "end": "00:14:46.700",
      "text": "I know I kept my microphone off and many of you did too."
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "start": "00:14:46.700",
      "end": "00:14:48.050",
      "text": "I will say on a previous council,"
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "start": "00:14:48.050",
      "end": "00:14:50.700",
      "text": "we have had beautiful singers in the past,"
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "start": "00:14:50.700",
      "end": "00:14:52.640",
      "text": "and I'm sure one of us is probably hiding"
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "start": "00:14:52.640",
      "end": "00:14:55.260",
      "text": "that talent at risk of having to sing for us"
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "start": "00:14:55.260",
      "end": "00:14:56.680",
      "text": "in each and every meeting,"
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "start": "00:14:56.680",
      "end": "00:15:00.160",
      "text": "but I appreciate everybody participating along."
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "start": "00:15:00.160",
      "end": "00:15:05.090",
      "text": "I'll look for disclosures of peon or interest, seeing none."
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "start": "00:15:05.090",
      "end": "00:15:07.870",
      "text": "Given this is a special meeting, we have no recognitions."
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "start": "00:15:07.870",
      "end": "00:15:09.610",
      "text": "We have no review of confidential matters"
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "start": "00:15:09.610",
      "end": "00:15:11.200",
      "text": "to be considered in public,"
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "start": "00:15:11.200",
      "end": "00:15:13.500",
      "text": "but we do have a couple of items"
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "start": "00:15:13.500",
      "end": "00:15:15.920",
      "text": "for council in closed session."
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "start": "00:15:15.920",
      "end": "00:15:17.430",
      "text": "So I will now at this time,"
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "start": "00:15:17.430",
      "end": "00:15:19.690",
      "text": "look for a motion to move into closed session move"
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "start": "00:15:19.690",
      "end": "00:15:23.080",
      "text": "by Deputy Mayor Lewis, seconded by Councillor Hopkins."
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "start": "00:15:23.080",
      "end": "00:15:35.300",
      "text": "We will open this in the system."
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "start": "00:15:35.300",
      "end": "00:15:38.670",
      "text": "Those in the vote motion carries 14 to zero."
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "start": "00:15:38.670",
      "end": "00:15:39.920",
      "text": "Okay, and it'll just take a moment."
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "start": "00:15:39.920",
      "end": "00:15:40.940",
      "text": "We are gonna stay here,"
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "start": "00:15:40.940",
      "end": "00:15:44.650",
      "text": "which means we have to ask our friends"
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "start": "00:15:44.650",
      "end": "00:15:47.700",
      "text": "in the audience and gallery to leave,"
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "start": "00:15:47.700",
      "end": "00:18:07.610",
      "text": "and we'll be set up in a few minutes."
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "start": "00:18:07.610",
      "end": "00:18:08.570",
      "text": "Okay, thank you."
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "start": "00:18:08.570",
      "end": "00:18:11.170",
      "text": "We've concluded in closed session."
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "start": "00:18:11.170",
      "end": "00:18:13.140",
      "text": "Item five, there are no confirmation"
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "start": "00:18:13.140",
      "end": "00:18:14.280",
      "text": "of signing of previous minutes."
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "start": "00:18:14.280",
      "end": "00:18:16.210",
      "text": "Six, no community communications,"
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "start": "00:18:16.210",
      "end": "00:18:19.940",
      "text": "our petitions, no motions for which notice was given."
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "start": "00:18:19.940",
      "end": "00:18:25.060",
      "text": "There is one report of the special SPPC meeting."
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "start": "00:18:25.060",
      "end": "00:18:28.460",
      "text": "You have that before you."
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "start": "00:18:28.460",
      "end": "00:18:38.540",
      "text": "I'll have the Deputy Mayor present that report."
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "start": "00:18:38.540",
      "end": "00:18:40.910",
      "text": "Thank you, Your Worship, and I'll remind you,"
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "start": "00:18:40.910",
      "end": "00:18:44.880",
      "text": "this is council two, so you get to stand up."
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "start": "00:18:44.880",
      "end": "00:18:46.400",
      "text": "Thank you, Your Worship, at this time,"
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "start": "00:18:46.400",
      "end": "00:18:48.520",
      "text": "I will report that the progress was made"
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "start": "00:18:48.520",
      "end": "00:18:51.140",
      "text": "for the item on which we went in camera."
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "start": "00:18:51.140",
      "end": "00:18:53.450",
      "text": "I don't have any other language to share."
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "start": "00:18:53.450",
      "end": "00:18:55.600",
      "text": "Actually, slightly different one."
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "start": "00:18:55.600",
      "end": "00:18:57.980",
      "text": "My mistake, I'm not quite to the report"
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "start": "00:18:57.980",
      "end": "00:18:59.530",
      "text": "out of the in-camera session."
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "start": "00:18:59.530",
      "end": "00:19:04.260",
      "text": "The SPPC report before us is the one that is basically"
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "start": "00:19:04.260",
      "end": "00:19:07.070",
      "text": "the report that shows that we went into camera"
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "start": "00:19:07.070",
      "end": "00:19:09.730",
      "text": "when we met as SPPC last month."
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "start": "00:19:09.730",
      "end": "00:19:11.600",
      "text": "So you're presenting the SPPC report"
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "start": "00:19:11.600",
      "end": "00:19:15.530",
      "text": "that's attached to the regular agenda."
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "start": "00:19:15.530",
      "end": "00:19:19.310",
      "text": "It has seven items to it."
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "start": "00:19:19.310",
      "end": "00:19:21.740",
      "text": "All of them are basically,"
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "start": "00:19:21.740",
      "end": "00:19:25.040",
      "text": "it's basically us going in camera."
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "start": "00:19:25.040",
      "end": "00:19:29.530",
      "text": "Okay, sorry, I missed the attachment."
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "start": "00:19:29.530",
      "end": "00:19:30.760",
      "text": "So you're willing to move that entire report?"
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "start": "00:19:30.760",
      "end": "00:19:32.980",
      "text": "So I will move that entire report."
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "start": "00:19:32.980",
      "end": "00:19:40.330",
      "text": "Excellent, any discussion on that SPPC report?"
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "start": "00:19:40.330",
      "end": "00:19:52.320",
      "text": "Okay, seeing none, we'll vote on that in the system."
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "start": "00:19:52.320",
      "end": "00:19:56.170",
      "text": "Those in the vote, motion carries 14 to zero."
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "start": "00:19:56.170",
      "end": "00:19:58.050",
      "text": "Before you sit down, we're on added reports,"
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "start": "00:19:58.050",
      "end": "00:20:01.940",
      "text": "which is reporting progress from our closed session."
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "start": "00:20:01.940",
      "end": "00:20:04.010",
      "text": "And now a report progress was made"
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "start": "00:20:04.010",
      "end": "00:20:06.740",
      "text": "on the item for which we went into closed session."
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "start": "00:20:06.740",
      "end": "00:20:07.750",
      "text": "Thank you for that."
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "start": "00:20:07.750",
      "end": "00:20:08.760",
      "text": "No deferred matters."
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "start": "00:20:08.760",
      "end": "00:20:12.650",
      "text": "There's no inquiries, no emergent motions."
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "start": "00:20:12.650",
      "end": "00:20:15.030",
      "text": "We have one bylaw, just the confirmation bylaw"
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "start": "00:20:15.030",
      "end": "00:20:16.880",
      "text": "for this meeting, Bill 45."
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "start": "00:20:16.880",
      "end": "00:20:18.830",
      "text": "I'll look for a move and a second to our first reading."
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "start": "00:20:18.830",
      "end": "00:20:22.640",
      "text": "Moved by Deputy Mayor Lewis, seconded by Councillor Cuddy."
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "start": "00:20:22.640",
      "end": "00:20:35.650",
      "text": "We'll open and voting in the system."
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "start": "00:20:35.650",
      "end": "00:20:41.650",
      "text": "Councillor Hill here, Councillor?"
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "start": "00:20:41.650",
      "end": "00:20:44.810",
      "text": "Yes, a little yes, a good thing out."
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "start": "00:20:44.810",
      "end": "00:20:46.090",
      "text": "Thank you."
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "start": "00:20:46.090",
      "end": "00:20:48.790",
      "text": "Close in the vote, motion carries 14 to zero."
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "start": "00:20:48.790",
      "end": "00:20:50.330",
      "text": "Moved seconder for second reading."
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "start": "00:20:50.330",
      "end": "00:20:53.140",
      "text": "Moved by Councillor Troz, seconded by Councillor Pribble."
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "start": "00:20:53.140",
      "end": "00:20:55.170",
      "text": "Any discussion on second reading?"
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "start": "00:20:55.170",
      "end": "00:21:06.220",
      "text": "Seeing none, we'll open that for voting."
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "start": "00:21:06.220",
      "end": "00:21:09.270",
      "text": "Those in the vote, motion carries 14 to zero."
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "start": "00:21:09.270",
      "end": "00:21:11.310",
      "text": "Third reading of the confirmation bylaw."
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "start": "00:21:11.310",
      "end": "00:21:14.350",
      "text": "Councillor Hopkins, seconded by Councillor Layman."
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "start": "00:21:14.350",
      "end": "00:21:26.240",
      "text": "We will open third reading for voting."
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "start": "00:21:26.240",
      "end": "00:21:29.990",
      "text": "Those in the vote, motion carries 14 to zero."
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "start": "00:21:29.990",
      "end": "00:21:31.730",
      "text": "Okay, that concludes bylaws."
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "start": "00:21:31.730",
      "end": "00:21:33.070",
      "text": "I just need a motion to adjourn."
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "start": "00:21:33.070",
      "end": "00:21:35.160",
      "text": "Moved by Councillor Stevenson, seconded by Councillor"
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "start": "00:21:35.160",
      "end": "00:21:38.560",
      "text": "Cutty, we'll do this by hand, all those in favor."
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "start": "00:21:38.560",
      "end": "00:21:39.400",
      "text": "Mad motion carries."
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "start": "00:21:39.400",
      "end": "00:21:40.400",
      "text": "All right, we're adjourned."
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "start": "00:21:40.400",
      "end": "00:21:40.800",
      "text": "Thank you."
    }
  ],
  "transcript_source": "lillian_skinner_archive",
  "transcript_source_url": "https://london.lillianskinner.ca/Meetings/Council/2024/01-31/.transcript.srt"
}